      "text": "$\\phi$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "88s5a",
      "text": "$\\left\\{\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right\\}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\tan (\\pi \\tan x)=\\cot (\\pi \\cot x)$\nor, $\\tan (\\pi \\tan x)=\\tan \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\pi \\cot x\\right)$\nor, $\\quad \\pi \\tan x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}-\\pi \\cot x$\nor, $\\tan x=\\frac{1}{2}-\\cot x$\nor, $\\quad \\tan x+\\cot x=\\frac{1}{2}$\nor, $\\quad \\frac{\\sin ^2 x+\\cos ^2 x}{\\sin x \\cos x}=\\frac{1}{2}$\nor, $\\quad \\frac{1}{\\sin 2 x}=\\frac{1}{4}$\nor, $\\quad \\sin 2 x=4 \\quad x \\in \\phi$",
    "image": null
  },
